### 1) BAŞARILI: Ayşe, oda 101, 3 gece → 201 (ikinci kez gönderilirse 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 1,
  "checkInDate": "2026-12-20",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-12-23",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### 2) ÇAKIŞMA: oda 201 zaten dolu → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 4,
  "checkInDate": "2026-12-22",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-12-26",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### 3) KAPASİTE: oda 102 en fazla 2 kişi → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 2,
  "checkInDate": "2027-01-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-01-12",
  "guestCount": 3
}

### 4) EKSİK ALAN → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "checkInDate": "2027-01-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-01-12"
}

### 5) OLMAYAN ODA → 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 999,
  "checkInDate": "2027-01-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-01-12",
  "guestCount": 1
}

### 6) Tüm rezervasyonlar
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations


# ============ ÖDEME + İPTAL AKIŞI ============
# 7'den 12'ye SIRAYLA çalıştır

### 7) Yeni rezervasyon (pending) → 201
# @name newRes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 3,
  "checkInDate": "2027-02-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-02-13",
  "guestCount": 1
}

### 8) HATALI ödeme yöntemi → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{newRes.response.body.id}}/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "bitcoin"
}

### 9) Ödeme yap → 201, rezervasyon "confirmed" olur
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{newRes.response.body.id}}/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "card"
}

### 10) Tekrar ödeme → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{newRes.response.body.id}}/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "card"
}

### 11) İptal et → 200, durum "cancelled"
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{newRes.response.body.id}}/cancel

### 12) Ödemeyi gör → durum "refunded"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{newRes.response.body.id}}/payment

### 13) Tekrar iptal → 400
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{newRes.response.body.id}}/cancel



# ============ CHECK-IN / CHECK-OUT AKIŞI ============
# 14'ten 21'e SIRAYLA çalıştır
# Tarihler otomatik: bugün → 2 gün sonra

### 14) BUGÜN başlayan rezervasyon (oda 401) → 201
# @name todayRes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 8,
  "checkInDate": "{{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD'}}",
  "checkOutDate": "{{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 2 d}}",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### 15) Ödemeden check-in → 400
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{todayRes.response.body.id}}/check-in

### 16) Ödeme yap (nakit) → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{todayRes.response.body.id}}/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "cash"
}

### 17) Check-in → 200, "checked_in"
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{todayRes.response.body.id}}/check-in

### 18) Giriş yapılmışken iptal → 400
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{todayRes.response.body.id}}/cancel

### 19) Check-out → 200, "checked_out"
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{todayRes.response.body.id}}/check-out

### 20) Tekrar check-out → 400
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/{{todayRes.response.body.id}}/check-out

### 21) Gelecek tarihli rezervasyona check-in (Ayşe, 20 Aralık) → 400
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1/check-in



# ============ ADMIN: ODA YÖNETİMİ ============
# 22'den 30'a SIRAYLA çalıştır

### 22) Yeni oda ekle (501, King Suite) → 201
# @name newRoom
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "501",
  "roomTypeId": 4,
  "floor": 5
}

### 23) Aynı numara tekrar → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "501",
  "roomTypeId": 4,
  "floor": 5
}

### 24) Boş oda numarası → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "   ",
  "roomTypeId": 1,
  "floor": 1
}

### 25) Olmayan oda tipi → 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "601",
  "roomTypeId": 99,
  "floor": 6
}

### 26) Odayı düzenle (Family Suite yap) → 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{newRoom.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "501",
  "roomTypeId": 3,
  "floor": 5
}

### 27) Pasife al → 200, isActive: false
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{newRoom.response.body.id}}/deactivate

### 28) Müsait arama → 501 listede OLMAMALI
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/available?checkIn=2027-04-01&checkOut=2027-04-03&guests=1

### 29) Tekrar aktifleştir → 200, isActive: true
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/{{newRoom.response.body.id}}/activate

### 30) Rezervasyonu olan odayı (201) pasife al → 409
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4/deactivate



